---

<ServicePage
  path="/services/websites"
  title="Websites & Hosting"
  description="Custom websites for Central Valley small businesses, built by hand and hosted on servers we run. Fast on a phone, and changed by the people who built it."
  intro="Custom websites built by hand and hosted on servers we own and run. No page builder, no platform subscription, and no one else's price rise to plan around. When something needs changing, you call the people who built it."
  capabilities={capabilities}
  serviceTypes={["Web Design", "Web Development", "Web Hosting"]}
  examples={examples}
  quoteService="Websites & Hosting"
  ctaTitle="Need a website, or a better one?"
  ctaText="Tell us about your business and what the site needs to do. The quote is free."
>
  <p>
    Most small business sites are a template on a rented platform: the same layout as the shop
    down the street, a monthly fee that only goes up, and nobody to call when it breaks. We build
    each site from scratch, so it loads fast, says what you do, and has nothing on it you
    didn&apos;t ask for.
  </p>
  <p>
    We host what we build, on hardware we run, with backups and updates handled. The site is
    yours: the domain is in your name, and if you ever want to take it elsewhere, the files go
    with you.
  </p>
</ServicePage>
